echo '<p>The subjects are not isolated. They are cross-linked — a reader moving through Biafra will find connections to Pogrom, Nigeria, History, Struggles, and Resistance. A reader exploring Esoterism will find connections to Religion, Tradition, and Africa. The library is designed to reward both focused reading and open exploration.</p>';

