echo '<li><strong><a href="/subjects/persons/">Persons</a></strong> — Individual biographical portraits of Igbo and African figures - lives examined in depth to illuminate larger histories.</li>';
echo '<li><strong><a href="/subjects/culture/">Culture</a></strong> — The living practices of Igbo cultural life - kola nut, title systems, masquerade, festivals, art, music, and the values that hold community together.</li>';
echo '<li><strong><a href="/subjects/religion/">Religion</a></strong> — The complete landscape of world religious traditions - with particular depth on Odinala (Igbo traditional religion) and the religious transformations of the colonial period.</li>';
